==Battleground==
*1 [[Koronium]] spawns as the boss after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*20 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Snache]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[THE METAL SLOTH]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Metal Seal]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threat in this stage is the nasty Koronium, who has above average range, high damage and level 4 Wave Attacks. Rush strategies are out of the question because the base has 900000 HP and a lot of nasty metal peons can easily stop DPS units from reaching it. Actually fighting Koronium is also easier said than done, as it requires stacking large quantities of Critical units in hopes of them landing one hit at the right moment, likely with the aid of the Thunderbolt Cannon. Otherwise, the stage is effectively lost. Crowd-controllers should still be brought for the Sir Metal Seals and Super Metal Hippoes.
If one Had the Super Rare Event Unit [[Costumed Witchy Neneko]] this Stage will become significantly easier, due do her medium range and [[Wave Shield]] ability and her ability to [[Critical Hit]] making he able to effectively Combat Koronium.

===Recommended Ubers===
*[[E. Kubilan Pasalan]]: Kubilan, despite having low damage, compensates with 100% Critical Chance and level 8 Waves. A well-timed attack from Kubilan can easily sweep across the field and quickly remove Koronium before he even gets close, trivializing the rest of the stage.
*[[Ultra Kaguya]]: Essentially powerful support, as she invalidates big threats while handling the smaller ones. Her fast attack rate combined with [[Metal Killer]] allows her to quickly cripple Sir Metal Seals and kill the weaker peons. And since she's highly stackable and outranges Koronium, she can potentially proc her [[Slow]] against it provided a bit of luck.

